0221108175017&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Key_Intihuatac_a913aa.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a the key Intihuatac.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 9.99 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Intihuatac, the key to the lost city of Iksupan.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Assembled as part of the <b>Galthen and the City of Gold</b> mission of the <a href=\"#/quest/adventures-of-galthen-quest\">Adventures of Galthen Quest</a> and used to access <a href=\"#/wiki/Iksupan\">Iksupan</a>.\n</p><p>In case you have lost this key after completing the quest you can reassemble a new one by collecting the ancient disc parts again in <a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul\">Roshamuul</a> by saying <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">lost key</span> to NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Sandomo\">Sandomo</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.<